# Installation

## dotnet magic

```
dotnet new create blazorwasm -o AlmToo

dotnet publish -c Release -o publish AlmToo.csproj 
```


## Required Packages

apt update
apt install npm
apt install dotnet-sdk-10.0

npm install -g @github/copilot
npx @opengsd/gsd-core@latest
npx @opengsd/gsd-pi@latest


